  <jpcrp_cor:NotesRegardingWriteDownsOfInventoriesTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearDuration">&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:8pt;font-size:8pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text5" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:19pt;text-indent:-19pt;line-height:13pt;"&gt;※３  棚&lt;span style="font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;font-size:9pt;"&gt;卸資産の期末棚卸高は収益性の低下に伴う簿価切下後の金額であり、次の棚&lt;/span&gt;卸資産評価損&lt;span style="font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;font-size:9pt;"&gt;が売上原価に含まれております。&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
